<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan end-June forex reserves up to US$90.025 bln.</title>
<headline>Taiwan end-June forex reserves up to US$90.025 bln.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's foreign exchange reserves inched higher to US$90.025 billion at the end of June from $90.008 billion at the end of May, the central bank said on Friday.</p>
</text>
